(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Nutrients in food.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising explaining what different nutrients do for the body.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Five kinds of nutrients.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Carbohydrates give energy. Proteins help the body grow and repair. Fats store energy. Vitamins and minerals keep the body healthy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A balanced diet.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A balanced diet has the right amounts of each nutrient. No single food gives us everything.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A meal of pap, chicken and spinach. Which nutrients does it give?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Pap gives carbohydrates for energy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Chicken gives protein for growth and repair.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Spinach gives vitamins, minerals and fibre. So this meal is quite balanced.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these foods by their main nutrient.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Starchy foods give carbohydrates.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Beans and eggs help muscles grow.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Fruit and vegetables give vitamins.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Rice and bread are carbohydrates, eggs and beans are proteins, oranges and carrots give vitamins and minerals.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which nutrient helps your body grow and repair itself?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Protein": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Fat": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Carbohydrate": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sugar": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think of what helps muscles and skin heal.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Found in beans, eggs and fish.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It starts with P.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Proteins help the body grow and repair itself.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "An athlete eats pasta before a race. Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "For carbohydrates, which give energy": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "For vitamins, which stop colds": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "For fat, which keeps them warm": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "For water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What does a runner need most during a race?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Pasta is a starchy food.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Starchy foods give energy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Pasta is rich in carbohydrates, which give the body energy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which lunch is the most balanced?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Brown bread, egg, an apple and water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Chips and a fizzy drink": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Only sweets": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Only an apple": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Look for a carbohydrate, a protein and a fruit or vegetable.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which lunch has variety?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Avoid too much sugar and fat.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Bread, egg and an apple give carbohydrates, protein, vitamins and fibre, with water.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why can't we live on one food only?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "No single food has all the nutrients we need": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "We would get bored": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It costs too much": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Foods go off": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Look at the nutrient table.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Does any one food give everything?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "We need variety.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Different foods give different nutrients, so we need a variety.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What helped you most?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The nutrient table": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thinking about my own meals": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The athlete example": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Eating a variety of foods helps your body and brain work well.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Nutrient. something in food that the body needs.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Carbohydrates. give energy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Proteins. help the body grow and repair.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Balanced diet. a mix of foods that gives all the nutrients.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
